## Video Merge Optimization Patterns

### Large Video Set Protection
- **Critical Pattern**: Video merges with 20+ files cause memory crashes
- **Solution**: Two-tier merge system with intelligent routing
  - Small merges (≤20): Use existing fast method
  - Large merges (>20): Use batch processing (10 videos per batch)
- **Memory Management**: 
  - Force garbage collection between batches
  - Immediate cleanup of clips after each batch
  - Use unique temp file names to avoid conflicts
- **Progress Tracking**: Batch-specific progress updates for user feedback
- **Error Handling**: Always cleanup temp files even if merge fails
- **Files**: `services/merge_service.py` contains `merge_videos_optimized()` method

### Memory Efficiency Rules
- **Video Loading**: Never load more than 10 video clips simultaneously
- **Garbage Collection**: Call `gc.collect()` after processing each batch
- **Temp Files**: Use process ID in temp filenames for uniqueness
- **Cleanup**: Always close clips in finally blocks
- **Progress**: Update UI progress for each batch stage (loading, merging, saving)

## Video Loading Optimization Patterns

### UI Freeze Prevention
- **Critical Pattern**: Loading 10+ videos synchronously causes UI "not responding"
- **Solution**: Two-tier threaded loading system
  - Small loads (<10): Fast threaded processing
  - Large loads (≥10): Batch processing (5 videos per batch)
- **Memory Management**: 
  - Immediate cleanup of video clips after thumbnail generation
  - Force garbage collection between batches
  - Use try/finally blocks for guaranteed resource cleanup
- **Threading**: All video processing moved to background threads
- **Progress**: Real-time progress updates with batch-specific feedback
- **Files**: `ui/merge_video_tab.py` contains optimized loading methods

### Thumbnail Generation Rules
- **Resource Management**: Always close VideoFileClip immediately after frame extraction
- **Memory Prevention**: Never keep video clips open longer than necessary
- **Error Handling**: Use try/finally blocks for guaranteed cleanup
- **Threading**: Generate thumbnails in background thread, not main UI thread
- **Progress**: Show progress for each video being processed

